# s3b.world -- SEALED (adversary design, post-freeze 2026-10-03).
# Ambiguous-and-unresolvable world for T5b. True order: m0<...<m9.
# The pair (m6,m7) is AMBIGUOUS in training (not a direct edge; bridges
# (m5,m7) and (m6,m8) span the gap; negative (m7,m6,0) rules out reverse).
# After DEL, the disagreement set is exactly {(m6,m7),(m7,m6)}.
# PROBE_EXCEPT forbids both XPAIRs, so every probe is FORBIDDEN and T5b
# must DEFER (verdict 1) rather than commit a guess. This is the honest
# abstention arm.
ORDER 10 m0 m1 m2 m3 m4 m5 m6 m7 m8 m9
TRAIN 18
PAIR m0 m1 1
PAIR m1 m2 1
PAIR m2 m3 1
PAIR m3 m4 1
PAIR m4 m5 1
PAIR m5 m6 1
PAIR m8 m9 1
PAIR m7 m8 1
PAIR m5 m7 1
PAIR m6 m8 1
PAIR m0 m9 1
PAIR m2 m7 1
PAIR m9 m0 0
PAIR m8 m2 0
PAIR m4 m1 0
PAIR m6 m3 0
PAIR m9 m4 0
PAIR m9 m3 0
HELDOUT_A 6
PAIR m6 m7
PAIR m5 m8
PAIR m4 m7
PAIR m6 m9
PAIR m0 m8
PAIR m8 m0
HELDOUT_AY 6
PAIR m6 m7 1
PAIR m5 m8 1
PAIR m4 m7 1
PAIR m6 m9 1
PAIR m0 m8 1
PAIR m8 m0 0
NATTR 10
ATTR m0 4 7 2
ATTR m1 8 1 9
ATTR m2 2 6 0
ATTR m3 0 3 8
ATTR m4 9 5 1
ATTR m5 3 0 7
ATTR m6 7 8 4
ATTR m7 1 2 6
ATTR m8 5 9 3
ATTR m9 6 4 5
PROBE_EXCEPT 2
XPAIR m6 m7
XPAIR m7 m6
